<p>If you like middlemen and mild chaos then welcome to the world of proxy servers. In plain terms a proxy is a gatekeeper that sits between two parties and manipulates traffic for fun and profit. The practical difference between a forward proxy and a reverse proxy comes down to placement and representation. One stands with the clients the other stands with the servers. That split decides why you would pick one or the other.</p>
